vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://127.0.0.1:8080
}

docs {
  `baseUrl` is set on the collection (Collection Settings > Vars).
  Run the collection top to bottom (or run *Accounts / List Accounts* first).

  Captured runtime variables:
  - `accountId` — first account returned by *List Accounts*
  - `reservationId` — set by *Create Reservation*
  - `dedupId` — fresh `X-Dedup-ID` generated by each mutating request

  All mutations (POST/DELETE under `/accounts/{id}/reservations`) require an
  `X-Dedup-ID` header. Re-sending the same key with the same request replays
  the stored response (`X-Dedup-Replayed: true`).
}
